Package: paperweight-chromebook
Architecture: all
Depends:
 paperweight-desktop,
 acpi,
 acpid,
 wtype,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: PaperweightOS hardware support for Chromebook 11 (3180)
 Sway config fragments for the Dell Chromebook 11 3180 running coreboot.
 Configures the Chromebook keyboard top-row as media/utility keys by default,
 with Search+key sending F1-F10. Also sets the internal display (eDP-1) output
 parameters explicitly.
 .
 Installs drop-in fragments into /etc/skel/.config/sway/config.d/ for
 automatic composition with the base paperweight-skel configuration.
